  "id": "intune-eam-app-catalog",
  "name": "Intune EAM App Catalog",
  "description": "Intune EAM App Catalog is a browsable, up-to-date reference of all Microsoft Intune Enterprise App Management (EAM) packages. It surfaces per-app pages with branch/version history, supports filters by publisher, architecture, locales, and auto-update capability, and tracks changes across catalog exports with daily/weekly/monthly changelogs and an RSS feed. Data is sourced from the Microsoft Graph API and rendered as static pages for deployment planning and compatibility checks.",
